              <img 
                src="/father.jpg" 
                alt="Rev. Dr. Dominic Savio, SJ - Principal, St. Xavier's College (Autonomous), Kolkata" 
                class="letter-image" 
                width="480" 
                height="480" 
                loading="eager" 
                style="object-fit: cover; object-position: top center;"
              />
              <div class="letter-caption">
                <span class="caption-name">Rev. Dr. Dominic Savio, SJ</span>
                <span class="caption-sub">Principal &bull; St. Xavier’s College (Autonomous), Kolkata</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Letter Text Content -->
          <div class="message-text-wrap">
            <div class="quote-symbol" aria-hidden="true">&ldquo;</div>
            <span class="eyebrow-accent">INSTITUTIONAL COMMUNIQUE &bull; 2ND EDITION</span>
            <h2 class="father-heading">Towards Greener Footprints &mdash; <em>A Collective Movement</em></h2>
            <p class="father-title">Rev. Dr. Dominic Savio, SJ</p>
            <p class="father-designation">Principal, St. Xavier's College (Autonomous), Kolkata</p>

            <blockquote class="father-letter-body" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1.25rem;">
              <p>
                It is with great pride and enthusiasm that I welcome you to the <strong>2nd Edition of Xavathon &mdash; Towards Greener Footprints</strong>, organised by <strong>St. Xavier’s College (Autonomous), Kolkata</strong>. What began in January 2026 has now blossomed into a collective movement, uniting the spirit of sport and well-being with our shared environmental responsibility.
              </p>
              <p>
                With <strong>3 km, 5 km, and 10 km races</strong>, we look forward to welcoming nearly <strong>3,000 runners</strong> &mdash; students, alumni, faculty, families, and citizens across Kolkata &mdash; united by a powerful idea: <em>every step can make a difference</em>. A footprint is not merely a mark left behind; it is a reminder of the impact we create through our choices and the greener world we wish to leave behind for generations to come.
              </p>
              <p>
                At St. Xavier’s College, education transcends the classroom. Xavathon embodies our commitment to nurture conscious, compassionate, and responsible citizens by transforming a sporting endeavour into a celebration of community, sustainability, and collective action.
              </p>
              <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; line-height: 1.6; border-left: 3px solid #10b981; padding-left: 0.85rem; margin: 0.4rem 0;">
                Let us run for health. Let us run for community. Let us run for our planet. Let us together, move Towards Greener Footprints.
              </p>
              <p>
                May Xavathon 2027 inspire us to run farther, live healthier, think greener, and leave behind footprints future generations will be proud to follow. Best wishes for a successful and memorable race!
              </p>
            </blockquote>

            <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
              <div class="sig-line"></div>
              <div class="sig-details">
                <strong style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #ffffff;">Rev. Dr. Dominic Savio, SJ</strong>
                <span style="color: #94a3b8;">Principal, St. Xavier’s College (Autonomous), Kolkata</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
